 ## Questions

+## Is Mahj Trainer the same as Mahjong Trainer: Learn & Win?
+
+No. Mahj Trainer: Mahjong Practice is by Jack Wallner on the App Store and E3 Apps on Google Play. Mahjong Trainer: Learn & Win is a separate app by Cedar Theory. Mahj Trainer has four free beginner practice rooms and coached solo hands, not bot matches or online multiplayer.
+
 ## Is there a mahjong app that quizzes you on which hand to play?

 Yes. Mahj Trainer shows you 13 tiles and asks which section of the card they fit, then explains the answer. In Play a Hand you commit to a section, then draw and discard for twelve turns while a coach grades every throw.
